    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Within Japanese territory, there is an island that calls itself an independent country called the \"Champon Kingdom,\" and it is still closed to the outside world. As a developed nation, the Japanese government, in an effort to force them to open up as soon as possible, sends Foreign Minister Fukuda and his son, Claude, to this strange island.",
        "jpn": "日本の領土内に“ちゃんぽん王国”という\r\n　独立国を名乗る島があり、未だに鎖国を続けて\r\n　いた。日本政府は先進国として、一刻も早く\r\n　彼らを開国させるため、福田外務大臣を息子の\r\n　クロードと共にこの奇妙な島へと送り込んだ。"
    },
